    "body": "### Version\r\n\r\n* vert.x core: 3.3.3\r\n* vert.x auth: 3.3.3\r\n\r\n### Context\r\n\r\nMongoAuth provides a method to add a new User: \r\n\r\n    void insertUser(String username, String password, List<String> roles, List<String> permissions,\r\n      Handler<AsyncResult<String>> resultHandler);\r\n\r\nThis approach does not provide any way to supply additional fields to the entry being saved. I suggest changing this method to add a JsonObject to which all data will be added before being stored:\r\n\r\n    void insertUser(JsonObject template, String username, String password, List<String> roles, List<String> permissions,\r\n      Handler<AsyncResult<String>> resultHandler);\r\n",
